	(text_box "Shunt resistor size :\nDifferential input's full scale is +/-40mV and we want to measure current up to 40 A.\nR1 = U/I = 1mΩ\nPower rating : P = RI² = 1.6W\n\nTVS diodes :\nOn this schematic, the diode is sized for the Vbatt bus. It has a breakdown voltage between 31.1V and 24.4V with a clamping voltage at 45.4V (note : The fuse is rated for 36V)"
